  "notes": "VCP 0xEA/0xEB set the register address (high/low 16 bits), VCP 0xEC reads (GET) or writes (SET, value <= 0xFF) one byte through the firmware's register helpers. Writes are limited to: 0x00000422, 0x00000426, 0x00000428, 0x00000434, 0x00000436, 0x0000043A, 0x0000043B, 0x0000044A, 0x0000044B, 0x0000044C, 0x0000044D, 0x2E902F4A, 0x2E902F4B. Reads are limited to the pages 0x0003xx, 0x0004xx, 0x101Exx and the scaler bank 0x102Fxx (any sub-bank); blocked reads return 0xFFFF. No EEPROM, flash, PM51 or factory-data access; all writes are volatile (power-cycle to undo). Generated by tools/patches_src_diag_poke.py."
